// Title: Potential MuddyWater APT Activity
// Sigma ID: 36222790-0d43-4fe8-86e4-674b27809543
// Status: test | Level: high
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2023-03-10 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: execution, stealth, G0069
// Tags: detection.emerging-threats
// Description: Detects potential Muddywater APT activity
// False positives:
//   - Unlikely
// References:
//   - https://www.mandiant.com/resources/blog/iranian-threat-group-updates-ttps-in-spear-phishing-campaign
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/05d1031f537e830b76da53bae2400c5814c89165/rules-emerging-threats/2018/TA/MuddyWater/proc_creation_win_apt_muddywater_activity.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, live Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where (ProcessCommandLine contains "vbscript:Close(Execute(\"CreateObject(" and ProcessCommandLine contains "powershell" and ProcessCommandLine contains "-w 1 -exec Bypass" and ProcessCommandLine contains "\\ProgramData\\") or (ProcessCommandLine contains "Win32_OperatingSystem" and ProcessCommandLine contains "Win32_NetworkAdapterConfiguration" and ProcessCommandLine contains "root\\SecurityCenter2" and ProcessCommandLine contains "[System.Net.DNS]") or (ProcessCommandLine contains "[Convert]::ToBase64String" and ProcessCommandLine contains "[System.Text.Encoding]::UTF8.GetString]" and ProcessCommandLine contains "GetResponse().GetResponseStream()" and ProcessCommandLine contains "[System.Net.HttpWebRequest]::Create(" and ProcessCommandLine contains "-bxor ")
